    {
      "id": 3,
      "name": "Torrent VPN tunnel",
      "description": "gluetun's own word for whether WireGuard is up, read from the control server inside the pod. The status code alone is not enough: this route answers 200 from the moment gluetun starts, with a body of \"stopped\" while the tunnel is still coming up. The keyword is the check. Down while the torrent stack is switched off, which is not a fault.",
      "type": "keyword",
      "url": "http://qbittorrent.jug.svc.cluster.local:8000/v1/vpn/status",
      "keyword": "\"status\":\"running\"",
